      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for aria2 fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in aria2:\n\n- CVE-2026-75421: stack buffer underflow in IOFile::getLine() when\n  a line begins with a NUL byte (boo#1276754)\n\n- Fix build with Nettle 4.0 [be1caa2d] (bsc#1257934)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
